<title>GERMANY: German VDA details 10-mo vehicle output, exports.</title>
<headline>German VDA details 10-mo vehicle output, exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Automobile Industry Association VDA gave the following data for motor vehicle production, exports and new registrations in October and for the first 10 months of 1996.</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p>Production</p>
<p>				  Oct 96		 Change vs Oct 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    402,500		+12 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks		    27,600		 +23 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 17,700		 +69 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    9,900		  -17 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    430,100		+13 pct</p>
<p>Exports</p>
<p>				  Oct 96		 Change vs Oct 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    245,200		+18 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks		    15,900		 +28 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 10,500		 +77 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    5,400		  -17 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    261,100		+18 pct</p>
<p>Estimated new registrations</p>
<p>				  Oct 96		 Change vs Oct 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    286,000		+7 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks		    21,700		 +10 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 15,500		 +19 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    6,200		  -8 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    307,700		+7 pct</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p>Production</p>
<p>				  Jan-Oct 96     Change vs Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    3,783,700	    +4 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks		    249,700		-1 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 156,600		+10 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    93,100		 -15 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    4,033,300	    +4 pct</p>
<p>Exports</p>
<p>				  Jan-Oct 96     Change vs Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    2,187,400	    +7 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks		    155,700		+9 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 101,000		+24 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    54,700		 -11 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    2,343,000	    +7 pct</p>
<p>Estimated new registrations</p>
<p>				  Oct 96		 Change vs Oct 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    3,003,300	    +7 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks		    204,700		-6 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes 143,300		-6 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	    61,500		 -6 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    3,208,100	    +6 pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
